/模块名称\n- 技术栈（React/Vue/原生）\n- 关键功能点\n- 是否需要 Jest/RTL/Cypress 格式输出","textSignature":"msg_0b8aa40eb7d5cf320169a6d0b73ea4819186a9257ffa34458a"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":865,"output":271,"cacheRead":15872,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":17008,"cost":{"input":0.00151375,"output":0.003794,"cacheRead":0.0027776,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00808535}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772540091990}}
