{"type":"message","id":"d9f82434","parentId":"4328b5bd","timestamp":"2026-03-03T12:25:25.116Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 对，**常驻**就是你理解的“一直在线”。\n\n简单说：\n\n- **常驻 agent**：像开了一个独立小窗口，持续保留上下文，不用每次重建  \n- **按需 agent**：你触发一次就创建一次，做完就结束；下次再新建\n\n你这边当前环境不支持前者（线程型），所以我们用后者。  \n但只要我把提示词+skills+脚本固定好，你体感上基本就是“专用 agent”。","textSignature":"msg_0b8aa40eb7d5cf320169a6d32b55f88191828d867c40bf1345"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":4302,"output":125,"cacheRead":17152,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21579,"cost":{"input":0.0075285,"output":0.00175,"cacheRead":0.0030015999999999997,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0122801}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772540721520}}
{"type":"message","id":"38f147c8","parentId":"d9f82434","timestamp":"2026-03-03T12:26:08.648Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Sender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"openclaw-control-ui\",\n  \"id\": \"openclaw-control-ui\"\n}\n```\n\n[Tue 2026-03-03 21:26 GMT+9] 明白 你看下这个 有帮助吗：📋 核心实现摘要\n\n🧩 三个核心 Skills\n\n*extract_design*\n* 功能: 解析设计书\n* 关键脚本: parse_design_excel.py\n\n*extract_code*\n* 功能: 解析LWC/Apex代码\n* 关键脚本: extract_code_rules.py\n\n*generate_testbook*\n* 功能: 生成测试书\n* 关键脚本: generate_high_precision.py\n\n\n🐍 使用的 Python 库\n\n\npandas # Excel读取\nopenpyxl # Excel生成\nPillow # 图片处理\nJinja2 # 模板渲染\ntabulate # Markdown表格\npytesseract # OCR文字识别（可选）\n\n\n📊 数据流转\n\n\n设计书.xlsx ──► parse_design_excel.py ──► design_rules.json\n │\nLWC代码 ─────► extract_code_rules.py ───► code_rules.json\n │\n ▼\n generate_high_precision.py\n │\n ┌─────────────────────────┘\n ▼\n UnitTestSpec_HighPrecision.md\n │\n ▼\n export_to_excel.py\n │\n ▼\n 単体試験書_WF001.xlsx\n\n\n🎯 关键技术点\n\n1. *设计书解析* • 用 openpyxl 读取单元格颜色（红色=必填）\n • 用正则提取校验规则\n\n2. *代码解析* • 正则提取 if/else 分支\n • 提取 @wire 数据绑定\n • 识别 DML 操作\n\n3. *测试生成* • Jinja2 模板渲染\n • 整合设计和代码规则\n • 自动编号和分类"}],"timestamp":1772540768645}}
